From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Tambe <tambewilliam@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:49:16 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] dt-bindings: Add the FonTamSOC

Add the vendor prefix of the FonTamSOC, the system on chip around the
ftpu RISC-V core, and the bindings of its devices: its interrupt
controller, the timer of its core, its UART, its SD host, its SPI master
and its default device.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: William Tambe <tambewilliam@gmail.com>
